  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>Patk. F. Dorgan, baker, is listed at No. 59 <ref target="civic?id=Madeline%20Street">Madeline Street</ref> in 1905 and 1910. In 1915 Daniel Dorgan, baker, is at the same number.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Patrick Dorgan, baker, is on the 1905 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 59 Madeline Street.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p><ref target="civic?id=John%20Anderson">John Anderson</ref>, boarding-house keeper, is next door at No. 57 in 1905, and John Hamilton in 1910. Mrs Leah Cohen is at No. 61 in 1905.</p>
      </div>
